"Body Drainer is the media's name for a pale teenage villain, a high school senior."
"He wore a black hoodie; the only public photos of him are smiling school pictures."
"The System chose him as a U-class a few months before his attack, and he did not register."
"His power drained strength and vitality from people, and the more he killed the stronger he got."
"He also moved fast, almost like a speed-agility type."
"He let out explosive energy bursts from his body that went through Hannah Elber's spells."
"His killing began at an early Halloween party at a Chicago nightclub."
"He killed 27 people: most at the nightclub, a few before it and three during the chase."
"Richard and Leah Thorn died in the fight that ended his rampage."
"Arjun Thomas killed him in Alden Thorn's bedroom as he ran at Alden to drain him."
